(mass-cg-runtime-harness)
*title Mass and CG runtime harness
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *initial ecfc x=0.0 y=0.0 z=0.0 xdt=0.0 ydt=0.0 zdt=0.0 time=0.0 mass=1500.0
  *file mass-cg-runtime.dat time wt config cg
  *segment 1 coast
    *integ dtprnt=0.1 dt=0.1
    *constants config=1.0
    *cg cg=(weight-cg)
    *when time>0.2 stop
*end

